{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……真难搞。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2578", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我想也是。我也不觉得瓜生君会那么轻易就投降。”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5377", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然明白，但是连告白都没办法。”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2579", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉我要开口时他就逃跑。好像鳗鱼一样。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2580", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“告白对象是鳗鱼啊……”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5378", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当葛格是很好，要交往的话防御力是铁壁。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2581", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是你不打算放弃吧？”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5379", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯。”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2582", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“必须想下一招呢。”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5380", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“早上去叫醒他，突然告白。”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2583", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然这样他一定得听，不过会认真看待吗？”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5381", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……半夜偷偷爬到床上。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2584", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“告白前……樱乃办得到呢。但是，那样子有意义吗？”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5382", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“用手机告白。”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2585", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“用电话讲好像会跟当面对话有相同的结果。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5383", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“用邮件告白。”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2586", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果他说没看到或是没收到呢？”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5384", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊唔……或许没其他方法了。”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2587", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃，你想得太偏执了。”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5385", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那爱理会怎么做？”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2588", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5386", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么做？”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2589", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，我想想……黄昏的顶楼之类的。”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5387", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“结女不能上去顶楼吧？”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2590", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“黄昏的海边，之类的。”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5388", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要去海边很远喔。”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2591", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“黄昏的──”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5389", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理喜欢黄昏？”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2592", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我也太偏执了呢。”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5390", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但告白不是都感觉在黄昏时刻吗？”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5391", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，没错。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2593", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过实际上并不一定是啦。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5392", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一起出去玩的时候，或是回家的时候？”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2594", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“浪漫的情境又不常见，所以一般都不是在那种状况吧。”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5393", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我的话，就是一起吃饭的时候、去葛格的房间玩的时候吧。”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2595", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5394", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2596", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉一点也不梦幻呢。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5395", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，是啊。”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2597", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是瓜生君好像会若无其事地开口。”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5396", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像是。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2598", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果被他告白你怎么办？”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5397", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“被葛格？大概……不可能。”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2599", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是的，那样还怎么聊，我是说如果啦。”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5398", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2600", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果被告白的话，一定会吓一跳。”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2601", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“以不吓一跳为前提的樱乃才是最让我惊讶的。”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "ar5399", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不实际发生我不知道。或许我会吓到拒绝他。”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2602", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2603", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "鞋子在。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "葛格回家了啊。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2604", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "怎么办？虽然跟爱理聊了很多，但结果还是没想到好主意。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……豁出去？”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2605", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与其做奇怪的事情，或许把心里的话直接说出来比较好。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯，就这样。”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2606", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是失败吃饭的时候会很尴尬，还是晚饭后──", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有电话。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂，我是瓜生。”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2607", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘喔，是亲爱的女儿，太好了。’", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0000", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爸爸。”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2608", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘抱歉一直让你这么辛苦。’", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0001", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要紧，葛格也在。”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2609", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘这么说来，新吾怎么样了？好久没跟他说话了。’", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0002", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爸爸好冷淡。”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2610", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘对儿子手下留情怎么行？’", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0003", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘爸爸跟儿子就是这样的吧，因为儿子是总有一天要打倒爸爸的存在。’", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0004", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爸爸跟葛格没有血缘关系。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是爸爸一直把葛格当成儿子来对待。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "葛格也知道，而且把他当成真正的爸爸相处。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟妈妈也一样。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "家人的话……就很简单的说。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘嗯，怎么了？开玩笑的。我不会跟新吾对决的你放心吧。’", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0005", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格的话，一定能和平解决。”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2611", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘……我想也是。’", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0006", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爸爸呵呵笑着。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且要对决的话，我是站在葛格这边的。”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2612", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘真是的，身为爸爸这种时候好悲伤啊……’", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0007", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘看来你们相处得很好。’", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0008", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，感情要好的兄妹。”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2613", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘那就好。’", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0009", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘要是背着爸妈做什么坏事，就要把你们赶出去了说。’", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0010", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2614", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘怎么，心虚吗？’", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0011", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有，真可惜。”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2615", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘可惜……你要当兄控是可以，但是偶尔也想起爸爸吧。’", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0012", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没问题，我总是在遥远的蓝天下祈祷你平安无事。”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2616", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘遥远是怎么样？算了，没回家的我也没资格说这些。’", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0013", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘工作的事再一阵子就会告一段落了，到时就配合妈妈的行程一起回去喔。’", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0014", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我会不抱期待的期待。”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2617", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘不愧是当我女儿这么多年了很懂嘛。那我有空再打回来。’", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0015", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爸爸，不要勉强自己喔。”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2618", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘好，要是有什么事……有新吾在所以没关系吧。’", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0016", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘如果有什么烦恼，随时都可以打给我喔。’", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "父亲", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "fa0017", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我会的。”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2619", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2620", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "背着父母……", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没错。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果我跟葛格两情相悦了，该怎么跟爸爸和妈妈说呢？", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爸爸跟妈妈应该不会反对……我觉得。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但只是我觉得，实际上还不知道。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "sk2621", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "切身感受到爱理说的“跟普通不同”了。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟葛格交往不是只有我们自己的问题。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
